# 6. Tool Comparison

### Software Package Managers

| **Tool** | **Main Purpose** | **Speed** | **Ease of Use** | **Best Use Case**                               |
| -------------- | ---------------------- | --------------- | --------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| **APT**  | Repository management  | Fast            | Very Easy             | General package installations and system upgrades     |
| **dpkg** | Direct installer       | Very Fast       | Medium                | Installing custom compiled offline`.deb` packages   |
| **Snap** | Sandbox deployments    | Moderate        | Easy                  | Cross-distro desktop apps and self-updating CLI tools |

### Service Init Systems

| **Tool**     | **Main Purpose**    | **Speed** | **Ease of Use** | **Best Use Case**                            |
| ------------------ | ------------------------- | --------------- | --------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |
| **systemd**  | Active daemon management  | Fast            | Easy                  | Default modern service management (Ubuntu 15.04+)  |
| **SysVinit** | Legacy init manager       | Slow            | Hard                  | Old distributions and lightweight systems          |
| **Upstart**  | Event-driven init manager | Moderate        | Medium                | Legacy Ubuntu installations (Ubuntu 6.06 to 14.10) |

